    "inputs": [
      "Optional: a low-resolution texture for `albedo_texture`."
    ],
    "outputs": "A checkered floor and crate whose texture bends across large triangles and whose edges sit on a coarse grid, with dithered colour."
  },
  "limits": "Affine warping depends on triangle size: finely subdivided meshes show little of it. Snapping happens in screen space, so the jitter is visible only with motion. Lighting is still Godot's per-pixel lighting, not per-vertex Gouraud.",
